As in a dream, you see yourself tumbling down a great, dark staircase. All about
you are shadowy images of struggles against fierce opponents and diabolical
traps. These give way to another round of images: of imposing stone figures, a
cool, clear lake, and, now, of an old, yet oddly youthful man. He turns toward
you slowly, his long, silver hair dancing about him in a fresh breeze. "You have
reached the final test, my friend! You are proved clever and powerful, but this
is not yet enough! Seek me when you feel yourself worthy!" The dream dissolves
around you as his last words echo through the void....

